Qobuz Connect
-------------
The Qobuz Connect protocol details used in src/kalinka_plugin_qobuz/connect/
(the mDNS advertisement, the /streamcore endpoints, the handoff payload, token
renewal, the cloud websocket's framing, the protobuf message definitions, and
the renderer's queue, state, volume and quality messages) were adapted from
Pibuz, https://github.com/PhilipVinc/pibuz, which is distributed under the MIT
